{"seq":1,"slug":"context-window-strategy","title":"上下文窗口策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/context-and-compaction/context-window-strategy","wordCount":1133,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文窗口策略\">上下文窗口策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Claude Code 的上下文管理是一套<strong>四层渐进式压缩架构</strong>，每层在「压缩力度 / 计算成本 / 信息保真度」三者间取不同平衡，并且严格按「能不调 API 就不调」的原则叠加：前三层（Snip / Microcompact / Context Collapse）纯本地操作，只有第四层 Auto Compact 调用 LLM 生成摘要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SNIP[&quot;Snip Compact&lt;br/&gt;移除旧 tool_result&quot;] --&gt; MICRO[&quot;Microcompact&lt;br/&gt;字段级压缩&quot;]&#10;    MICRO --&gt; COLLAPSE[&quot;Context Collapse&lt;br/&gt;投影式折叠&quot;]&#10;    COLLAPSE --&gt; AUTO[&quot;Auto Compact&lt;br/&gt;LLM 摘要&quot;]\">graph TD\n    SNIP[\"Snip Compact&lt;br/&gt;移除旧 tool_result\"] --&gt; MICRO[\"Microcompact&lt;br/&gt;字段级压缩\"]\n    MICRO --&gt; COLLAPSE[\"Context Collapse&lt;br/&gt;投影式折叠\"]\n    COLLAPSE --&gt; AUTO[\"Auto Compact&lt;br/&gt;LLM 摘要\"]</pre><p>各层按触发条件逐级启用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>API 调用</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一</td>\n<td>Snip Compact</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>每轮自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二</td>\n<td>Microcompact</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>每轮自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三</td>\n<td>Context Collapse</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>超过 70% 窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四</td>\n<td>Auto Compact</td>\n<td>是（LLM）</td>\n<td>超过阈值或 413</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>要点：</strong> 四层是「成本递增、保真递减」的阶梯——能用便宜的本地压缩解决，就不动用昂贵的 LLM 摘要。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"四层压缩架构\">四层压缩架构</h2><p>Claude Code 的上下文管理核心是一套四层渐进式压缩架构。每一层在三个维度上取得不同的平衡：压缩力度（释放多少 token）、计算成本（是否需要 API 调用）和信息保真度（保留多少原始信息）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 第一层&#10;        SNIP[&quot;Snip Compact&quot;]&#10;        SNIP_DESC[&quot;移除旧 tool_result 内容&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 第二层&#10;        MICRO[&quot;Microcompact&quot;]&#10;        MICRO_DESC[&quot;缓存的字段级压缩&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 第三层&#10;        COLLAPSE[&quot;Context Collapse&quot;]&#10;        COLLAPSE_DESC[&quot;投影式折叠旧消息&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 第四层&#10;        AUTO[&quot;Auto Compact&quot;]&#10;        AUTO_DESC[&quot;LLM 驱动的完整摘要&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SNIP --&gt; MICRO --&gt; COLLAPSE --&gt; AUTO&#10;    SNIP_DESC --&gt; MICRO_DESC --&gt; COLLAPSE_DESC --&gt; AUTO_DESC\">graph TD\n    subgraph 第一层\n        SNIP[\"Snip Compact\"]\n        SNIP_DESC[\"移除旧 tool_result 内容\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 第二层\n        MICRO[\"Microcompact\"]\n        MICRO_DESC[\"缓存的字段级压缩\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 第三层\n        COLLAPSE[\"Context Collapse\"]\n        COLLAPSE_DESC[\"投影式折叠旧消息\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 第四层\n        AUTO[\"Auto Compact\"]\n        AUTO_DESC[\"LLM 驱动的完整摘要\"]\n    end\n    SNIP --&gt; MICRO --&gt; COLLAPSE --&gt; AUTO\n    SNIP_DESC --&gt; MICRO_DESC --&gt; COLLAPSE_DESC --&gt; AUTO_DESC</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>API 调用</th>\n<th>压缩力度</th>\n<th>信息保真度</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一层</td>\n<td>Snip Compact</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低（20-40%）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>每轮自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二层</td>\n<td>Microcompact</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低（10-20%）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>每轮自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三层</td>\n<td>Context Collapse</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中（30-50%）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超过 70% 窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四层</td>\n<td>Auto Compact</td>\n<td>是（LLM）</td>\n<td>高（50-80%）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>超过阈值或 413</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 四层架构的设计哲学是&quot;能不调 API 就不调&quot;。前三层都是纯本地操作，只有在上下文真正不够用时才启用第四层的 LLM 摘要。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"触发条件与时机\">触发条件与时机</h2><p>每一层压缩在查询循环中的不同位置触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/query/query.ts — 压缩触发时机（简化）&#10;async function* queryLoop(params: QueryLoopParams): AsyncGenerator&lt;SDKMessage&gt; {&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    // 第一层 + 第二层：每轮自动执行&#10;    snipCompact(params.messages);&#10;    applyCachedMicrocompaction(params.messages);&#10;&#10;    // 第三层：超过阈值时执行&#10;    const tokenEstimate = estimateTokens(params.messages);&#10;    if (feature(&#39;CONTEXT_COLLAPSE&#39;) &amp;&amp; tokenEstimate &gt; params.contextWindow * 0.7) {&#10;      projectedCollapseView(params.messages, params.collapseConfig);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 第四层：超过更高阈值时执行&#10;    if (tokenEstimate &gt; params.contextWindow * 0.9) {&#10;      yield* autoCompact(params.messages, params.config);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      const response = yield* callAPI(params);&#10;      // ... 正常处理&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      if (isPromptTooLong(error)) {&#10;        // 第四层（reactive）：413 错误触发&#10;        yield* reactiveCompact(params.messages, params.config);&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;      throw error;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/query/query.ts — 压缩触发时机（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryLoop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryLoopParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AsyncGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SDKMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 第一层 + 第二层：每轮自动执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    snipCompact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    applyCachedMicrocompaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 第三层：超过阈值时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tokenEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimateTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">feature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONTEXT_COLLAPSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenEstimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.contextWindow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      projectedCollapseView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages, params.collapseConfig);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 第四层：超过更高阈值时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tokenEstimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.contextWindow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      yield*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autoCompact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages, params.config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> yield*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callAPI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // ... 正常处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isPromptTooLong</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 第四层（reactive）：413 错误触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        yield*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactiveCompact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.messages, params.config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant QL as queryLoop&#10;    participant S as Snip&#10;    participant M as Microcompact&#10;    participant CC as Context Collapse&#10;    participant AC as Auto Compact&#10;    participant API as Anthropic API&#10;&#10;    loop 每次迭代&#10;        QL-&gt;&gt;S: snipCompact() [每轮]&#10;        QL-&gt;&gt;M: applyCachedMicrocompaction() [每轮]&#10;        QL-&gt;&gt;QL: estimateTokens()&#10;        alt &gt; 70% 窗口&#10;            QL-&gt;&gt;CC: projectedCollapseView()&#10;        end&#10;        alt &gt; 90% 窗口&#10;            QL-&gt;&gt;AC: autoCompact() [LLM 调用]&#10;        end&#10;        QL-&gt;&gt;API: callAPI()&#10;        alt 413 error&#10;            API--&gt;&gt;QL: prompt-too-long&#10;            QL-&gt;&gt;AC: reactiveCompact() [紧急]&#10;        end&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant QL as queryLoop\n    participant S as Snip\n    participant M as Microcompact\n    participant CC as Context Collapse\n    participant AC as Auto Compact\n    participant API as Anthropic API\n\n    loop 每次迭代\n        QL-&gt;&gt;S: snipCompact() [每轮]\n        QL-&gt;&gt;M: applyCachedMicrocompaction() [每轮]\n        QL-&gt;&gt;QL: estimateTokens()\n        alt &gt; 70% 窗口\n            QL-&gt;&gt;CC: projectedCollapseView()\n        end\n        alt &gt; 90% 窗口\n            QL-&gt;&gt;AC: autoCompact() [LLM 调用]\n        end\n        QL-&gt;&gt;API: callAPI()\n        alt 413 error\n            API--&gt;&gt;QL: prompt-too-long\n            QL-&gt;&gt;AC: reactiveCompact() [紧急]\n        end\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"token-估算\">Token 估算</h2><p>所有压缩决策都依赖 token 估算。Claude Code 使用快速的字符级估算而非精确的分词器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/utils/token-estimate.ts — Token 估算（简化）&#10;function estimateTokens(input: string | SDKMessage[]): number {&#10;  if (typeof input === &#39;string&#39;) {&#10;    return Math.ceil(input.length / 3.5);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let total = 0;&#10;  for (const msg of input) {&#10;    const content = typeof msg.content === &#39;string&#39; ? msg.content : JSON.stringify(msg.content);&#10;    total += Math.ceil(content.length / 3.5);&#10;    total += 4; // message overhead&#10;  }&#10;  return total;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/utils/token-estimate.ts — Token 估算（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimateTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SDKMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'string'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span 