0K 窗口的旧一代模型，已落后两代以上；当前版本模型线推进到 Sonnet 5（原生 1M token 上下文窗口）等，auto-compact 窗口也改为可配置项（见<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/model-config\">官方模型配置文档</a>）。这里的结构（每模型一组阈值）仍是理解压缩分层的好模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/constants/models.ts — 模型上下文窗口（简化）&#10;interface ModelConfig {&#10;  contextWindow: number;&#10;  maxOutputTokens: number;&#10;  compactThreshold: number;&#10;  collapseThreshold: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const MODEL_CONFIGS: Record&lt;string, ModelConfig&gt; = {&#10;  &#39;claude-sonnet-4-20250514&#39;: {&#10;    contextWindow: 200_000,&#10;    maxOutputTokens: 16_000,&#10;    compactThreshold: 0.9,&#10;    collapseThreshold: 0.7,&#10;  },&#10;  &#39;claude-opus-4-20250514&#39;: {&#10;    contextWindow: 200_000,&#10;    maxOutputTokens: 32_000,&#10;    compactThreshold: 0.9,&#10;    collapseThreshold: 0.7,&#10;  },&#10;  &#39;claude-haiku-3-20241022&#39;: {&#10;    contextWindow: 200_000,&#10;    maxOutputTokens: 8_000,&#10;    compactThreshold: 0.85,&#10;    collapseThreshold: 0.65,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/constants/models.ts — 模型上下文窗口（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  contextWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxOutputTokens</span><span style=\"c